  "titles": {
    "_tiers_note": "Egyptian backbone, ascending. Hatia (mayor) barony; Wer-khaset (great-one of the frontier-land) march; Sepati/Sepat (nomarch/nome) county; Mer-mesha (army-overseer) duchy; Heqa-aa (great ruler) principality; Nesut (king) kingdom; Per-aa (the Great House) empire. Ge'ez overlay: the southern savanna marches are styled in Ge'ez (a frontier-lord may be hailed Negash or Ras). (Rank titles are the real Egyptian/Ge'ez register, allowed.)",
